  "description": "Kwon Yeong had passed the highest imperial examination at a young age and was dreaming of a brilliant future. Suddenly, he manifests as a ‘Yin’ being (Omega), and everything comes crashing down.\n\nJust as Yeong is about to be sold off as the concubine of some old lecher or the wife of a butcher, a marriage proposal arrives one day from Hwan, his closest friend and mischievous companion…\n\n*“I’ll even address you as ‘husband’! I’ll just be your wife, won’t I!”* *(Source: RIDI, translated)*\n\nCharacter Profiles\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2213012529), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000104955), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=923010526), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/qlskfl)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404039374), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404039375)",
